0 FILE 8840 - LegoRally Shock n' Roll Racer Model B - main.ldr
0 A yellow Technic rally car B-model featuring an engine with pistons and crankshaft, gears, shock absorbers, body panels with racing stripes and 'RALLY' decals, and a Technic action figure driver.
